{"fiche":"PRELEVEMENT","contenus":[{"id":"052f7a36-dec7-4221-b429-63d663f2d92d","racine_id":"052f7a36-dec7-4221-b429-63d663f2d92d","version":1,"type":"geste","titre":"Friction hydro-alcoolique des mains","resume":"Avant et après chaque soin, après le retrait des gants.","corps":{"etapes":[{"texte":"Retirer bagues, montre et bracelets ; ongles courts, sans vernis.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Déposer une dose de solution hydro-alcoolique qui remplit le creux de la main.","vigilance":"Mains visiblement souillées : lavage au savon doux d'abord, séchage complet, puis friction."},{"texte":"Frictionner paume contre paume, puis le dos de chaque main, doigts entrecroisés.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Frictionner le dos des doigts, les pouces, puis le bout des doigts et les ongles dans la paume opposée.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Terminer par les poignets ; frictionner jusqu'à séchage complet, sans essuyer.","vigilance":"Une friction trop courte (moins de 20 à 30 secondes) laisse des zones non désinfectées."}],"materiel":["Solution hydro-alcoolique (flacon de poche)"]},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-26T07:40:19.630435+00:00","relu":{"par":"Dr Jean Marchand","le":"2026-11-18T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Dr Jean Marchand","qualite":"Médecin","le":"2026-11-18","revision_le":"2027-11-18"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":4,"utile":2,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"1a8d633e-2300-4fbb-a456-dd41ca5764f2","racine_id":"1a8d633e-2300-4fbb-a456-dd41ca5764f2","version":1,"type":"geste","titre":"Prélèvement veineux à domicile : bonnes pratiques","resume":"De l'identification du patient au dépôt au laboratoire.","corps":{"etapes":[{"texte":"Vérifier l'identité du patient et l'ordonnance ; contrôler les conditions demandées (à jeun, horaire, traitement pris ou non).","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Préparer les tubes du laboratoire destinataire et vérifier leur date de péremption.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Hygiène des mains, garrot posé moins d'une minute, antisepsie du point de ponction.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Remplir les tubes dans l'ordre recommandé par le laboratoire ; retourner doucement chaque tube.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Étiqueter les tubes au domicile, devant le patient, avant de partir.","vigilance":"Un tube non étiqueté ou mal identifié est refusé : jamais d'étiquetage différé dans la voiture."},{"texte":"Compléter la fiche de prélèvement (heure, préleveur) ; respecter délai et température de transport.","vigilance":"Délai et température d'acheminement : se référer au manuel de prélèvement du laboratoire."}],"materiel":["Tubes et corps de prélèvement","Garrot","Antiseptique et compresses","Collecteur à aiguilles","Boîte de transport"]},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["PRELEVEMENT"],"tags":["pré-analytique","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-26T07:40:19.630435+00:00","relu":{"par":"Dr Jean Marchand","le":"2026-11-15T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Dr Jean Marchand","qualite":"Médecin","le":"2026-11-15","revision_le":"2027-11-15"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":4,"utile":3,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"67efabe5-45a8-4964-a1b8-843d016ddd95","racine_id":"67efabe5-45a8-4964-a1b8-843d016ddd95","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"La friction hydro-alcoolique, comment ?","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"1:30","credit":"Hôpitaux universitaires de Genève · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"IXiGWkMu27E"},"source":"Hôpitaux universitaires de Genève","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-26T07:40:19.630435+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-11-14T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-11-14","revision_le":"2027-11-14"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":6,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"fe51a069-6c3c-4c41-a471-3077aebdf10d","racine_id":"fe51a069-6c3c-4c41-a471-3077aebdf10d","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"Les bonnes pratiques du prélèvement biologique","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"5:51","credit":"CHA · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"6hah8g_MN68"},"source":"CHA","fiches":["PRELEVEMENT"],"tags":["pré-analytique","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-26T07:40:19.630435+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-21T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-21","revision_le":"2027-10-21"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":6,"utile":3,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"2e3615ac-544b-458d-b8bc-325be53ac868","racine_id":"2e3615ac-544b-458d-b8bc-325be53ac868","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"Désinfection des mains par friction hydro-alcoolique","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"1:05","credit":"Gustave Roussy · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"_MtZJsdr824"},"source":"Gustave Roussy","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-26T07:40:19.630435+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-11-11T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-11-11","revision_le":"2027-11-11"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":6,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"5b78684b-2647-43eb-95aa-d0be4415e9dc","racine_id":"5b78684b-2647-43eb-95aa-d0be4415e9dc","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"La désinfection des mains par friction hydro-alcoolique","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"2:00","credit":"Hôpital universitaire Robert-Debré · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"KFK7f8IMGe8"},"source":"Hôpital universitaire Robert-Debré","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-26T07:40:19.630435+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-11-08T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-11-08","revision_le":"2027-11-08"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":6,"utile":2,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"51f146ad-1110-495e-8fb7-9a4540ed53da","racine_id":"51f146ad-1110-495e-8fb7-9a4540ed53da","version":1,"type":"question","titre":"Quelle hygiène des mains entre deux soins chez le même patient ?","resume":null,"corps":{},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Paul Durand","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-26T07:40:19.630435+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-11-18T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-11-18","revision_le":"2027-11-18"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":6,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[{"id":"65611709-b122-439a-bf60-dd29bee94392","texte":"Friction hydro-alcoolique avant et après chaque soin, y compris chez le même patient quand on passe d'un site contaminé (change, plaie) à un site propre (injection, cathéter), et après le retrait des gants. Lavage au savon doux seulement si les mains sont visiblement souillées, puis friction une fois les mains sèches.","source":"SF2H, bonnes pratiques en soins de ville, 2015","auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-26T07:40:19.630435+00:00","validee":true,"validee_par":"Dr Jean Marchand, Médecin","validee_le":"2026-11-18"}]},{"id":"6e2364dc-1fe4-40de-bfbf-d4436a0181bc","racine_id":"6e2364dc-1fe4-40de-bfbf-d4436a0181bc","version":1,"type":"document","titre":"Bonnes pratiques essentielles en hygiène en soins de ville","resume":null,"corps":{"url":"https://www.sf2h.net/k-stock/data/uploads/2015/11/SF2H_recommandations_bonnes-pratiques-essentielles-en-hygiene-a-l-usage-des-professionnels-de-sante-en-soins-de-ville-2015.pdf"},"source":"SF2H, 2015","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-26T07:40:19.630435+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-11-06T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-11-06","revision_le":"2027-11-06"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":6,"utile":0,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"527b76c3-99d7-4f43-8c6c-fda7ec3d5c1a","racine_id":"527b76c3-99d7-4f43-8c6c-fda7ec3d5c1a","version":1,"type":"document","titre":"Hygiène des mains"